 "says": "A workstream and a repository memory source are set up, and two choices on the local journal mode are published there: first a rollback journal, then WAL, which replaces the first whole. An inspection (reader.body.read, role memory, reviewer view, history included) returns the current WAL choice as the winning required unit and the replaced choice as a shadowed optional unit with what shadows it, and its result carries no use: reading it admitted nothing. The reader then offers what it inspected as a use (memory.use.prepare with an envelope declaring it retains the inspected body and that result's qualifications). The owner refuses it with use_not_admitted: no pending question, qualified state or admitted use is returned, and nothing is written.",
 "spec_sha256": "47aa7559969406c8cf7147e9ed9deb900bb404466ef769f51250f13c18f4c5e6",
